7:[["$","section",null,{"className":"pageHero","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"IMAGE PROMPTING · 10 MIN"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"How to Write AI Image Prompts Like an Art Director."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A practical system for subject, composition, light, lens and production constraints."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article guideArticle","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"articleMeta","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Published September 3, 2026"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Editorial team · PromptStudio AI"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"lead","children":"Useful image prompts are creative briefs, not adjective collections. The goal is to make a small number of compatible visual decisions that a model can execute and a human can evaluate."}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"toc","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"IN THIS GUIDE"}],[["$","a","Begin with the job of the image",{"href":"#s0","children":[1,". ","Begin with the job of the image"]}],["$","a","Build the prompt in production order",{"href":"#s1","children":[2,". ","Build the prompt in production order"]}],["$","a","Use camera language only when it changes the result",{"href":"#s2","children":[3,". ","Use camera language only when it changes the result"]}],["$","a","Protect what must not change",{"href":"#s3","children":[4,". ","Protect what must not change"]}]]]}],[["$","section","Begin with the job of the image",{"id":"s0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Begin with the job of the image"}],[["$","p","Before describing style, state what the image must accomplish. A marketplace packshot needs accurate geometry and clear edges. A campaign hero needs emotion, hierarchy and space for copy. A headshot needs trust and identity fidelity. The same visual treatment cannot serve all three jobs equally well.",{"children":"Before describing style, state what the image must accomplish. A marketplace packshot needs accurate geometry and clear edges. A campaign hero needs emotion, hierarchy and space for copy. A headshot needs trust and identity fidelity. The same visual treatment cannot serve all three jobs equally well."}],["$","p","Write one sentence that names the subject, audience and destination. For example: “A landing-page hero for a premium coffee subscription aimed at design-conscious urban professionals.” That sentence becomes the test for every later choice.",{"children":"Write one sentence that names the subject, audience and destination. For example: “A landing-page hero for a premium coffee subscription aimed at design-conscious urban professionals.” That sentence becomes the test for every later choice."}]]]}],["$","section","Build the prompt in production order",{"id":"s1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build the prompt in production order"}],[["$","p","A reliable order is subject, setting, composition, lighting, material or styling, camera, output format and constraints. This mirrors how a photographer or art director would make decisions. It also lets you revise one layer without rewriting everything.",{"children":"A reliable order is subject, setting, composition, lighting, material or styling, camera, output format and constraints. This mirrors how a photographer or art director would make decisions. It also lets you revise one layer without rewriting everything."}],["$","p","Keep the subject concrete. Replace “a beautiful product photo” with the product type, material, color and immutable details. Replace “cinematic lighting” with direction, softness, contrast and color temperature. Specific decisions produce more testable results than prestige words.",{"children":"Keep the subject concrete. Replace “a beautiful product photo” with the product type, material, color and immutable details. Replace “cinematic lighting” with direction, softness, contrast and color temperature. Specific decisions produce more testable results than prestige words."}]]]}],"$L11","$L12"],"$L13","$L14"]}]]
